      "If a worker begins work and then interrupts it due to weather conditions, they are entitled to remuneration and cannot be placed on weather-related unemployment for that day. If work cannot begin upon arrival at the site, construction regulations permit unemployment for that day.",
      "Report the first actual day to ONEM monthly on the same day or the next business day; the preceding business day is possible if unemployment is certain. Submit DRS scenario 2 when necessary and DRS scenario 5 after the month.",
